      <title>特斯拉中国上架浅色头枕腰靠 219元起售</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%9E%B6%E6%B5%85%E8%89%B2%E5%A4%B4%E6%9E%95%E8%85%B0%E9%9D%A0-219%E5%85%83%E8%B5%B7%E5%94%AE/</link>
